---
// ContactSection.astro
---

<div class="border-t border-[var(--text-color)]/20 pt-24 pb-12 mt-16 text-center">
  <h2 class="animate-on-scroll text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6">
    ¿Trabajamos juntos?
  </h2>
  
  <p class="animate-on-scroll text-lg md:text-xl font-medium opacity-80 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
    Si estás buscando un desarrollador full-stack para tu equipo o tienes un proyecto en mente, me encantaría escucharlo.
  </p>

  <div class="animate-on-scroll flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
    <a 
      href="mailto:isaipaucar@gmail.com" 
      class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-[var(--accent-color)] text-white hover:opacity-90 font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-lg shadow-[0_4px_20px_var(--shadow-accent)] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_var(--shadow-accent)] hover:-translate-y-1"
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
        <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
      </svg>
      Envíame un correo
    </a>
    
    <a 
      href="/contacto" 
      class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-transparent border border-[var(--text-color)]/30 text-[var(--text-color)] hover:bg-[var(--text-color)]/10 font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg hover:-translate-y-1"
    >
      Ver más redes
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
